ion:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:revision:9","quote":"多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂平行对照、三剂量组（0.25mg BID/0.5mg BID/安慰剂1:1:1）设计；血液透析人群口服给药8周+2周安全随访。","quote_sha256":"ddc406df7f5484e2fcf536b3df7728545dcd261c5857f97bb1f06538b17801e1","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:r9:e734f05c4d419492","span_id":"es_design_3arm"},{"locator":"section:8 统计学考虑|block:1056|chunk:1","quote":"有效性评价、安全性评价、PK 评价、PD 评价、免疫原性评价以及其他分析将在本研究的统计分析计划（SAP）中详细规定，数据库锁定前将最终确定 SAP。","quote_sha256":"a635fe9c51c78cbc66090c3553c488cd453e807e61608a97e0767740d5088a03","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a3cf98aab983c7","span_id":"es_sap_structure"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:revision:9","quote":"筛选、基线/D1、W2、W4、W6、W8终点、W10安全随访（±3天窗口），每2周一次透析日院内访视","quote_sha256":"e26ae29f2e85d9e5a66b25d76f3f297fd4ba3647d70df4c6113a46b03de07dec","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:r9:e734f05c4d419492","span_id":"es_visit_strategy"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_safety_endpoints","es_stat_strategy","es_design_3arm","es_sap_structure","es_visit_strategy"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":1,"project_fact_spans":4},"gap_items":[{"action":"确认MedDRA版本、CTCAE版本及实验室检查正常范围判定方式","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_safety_01","missing_source_classes":["项目安全性分析计划"],"target":"安全性分析章节-TEAE编码与分级标准"},{"action":"确认重大方案偏离的具体定义和阈值","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_safety_02","missing_source_classes":["项目方案偏离分类标准"],"target":"安全性分析章节-PPS方案偏离排除条款"},{"action":"确认安全性分析中QTcF异常阈值是否沿用排除标准中450ms或另行设定","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_safety_03","missing_source_classes":["项目安全性分析计划"],"target":"安全性分析章节-QTcF分析阈值"}],"heading":"安全性数据分析","missing_source_classes":["项目安全性分析计划（含TEAE编码版本、CTCAE版本、实验室正常范围判定标准）","项目方案偏离分类标准（重大/非重大方案偏离定义）","项目SAP草案或模板"],"proposal_text":"安全性分析基于安全性分析集（SS）进行，SS定义为至少接受一次研究药物（KRX-203片或安慰剂）的受试者，按实际接受的药物治疗归组。全分析集（FAS）定义为随机化后至少接受一次研究药物且至少完成一次疗效评估的受试者，按随机分组分析，用于主要疗效终点分析。符合方案集（PPS）定义为完成全部关键评估访视且无重大方案偏离的受试者；存在重大方案偏离者不纳入PPS，重大方案偏离的具体判定标准将在统计分析计划中明确。安全性分析采用描述性统计方法，不设置假设检验。治疗期间不良事件（TEAE）的发生率按治疗组（0.25mg BID组、0.5mg BID组、安慰剂组）分别汇总，计算各组TEAE发生率及95%置信区间。严重不良事件（SAE）逐例列出并描述。生命体征和实验室检查按治疗组汇总，计算各时间点与基线的变化值及变化百分比。12导联心电图QTcF间期按治疗组汇总，分析QTcF较基线变化。安全性随访期为末次给药后2周（D57至D70），此期间新发或加重的不良事件纳入安全性分析。所有安全性分析的具体变量列表、分析时点、缺失数据处理规则及亚组分析策略将在统计分析计划（SAP）中详细规定，SAP于数据库锁定前最终确定。","rationale":"安全性终点（TEAE/SAE发生率、生命体征、实验室检查、12导联ECG）及治疗期8周加2周安全随访为项目已确认事实；FAS/SS/PPS分析集框架参照公司语料中SAP结构惯例；TEAE编码版本、CTCAE版本、实验室正常范围判定方式及PPS中重大方案偏离的具体阈值需项目文件确认。","review_advisories":["本节引用公司语料形成共性表述；定稿时请用本项目权威文件复核适用性。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_ad1ab8acc74f_4766945330deb74b","section_number":"9.5","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:aa5c2381f3120ea152da0a15","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:r9:e734f05c4d419492","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a3cf98aab983c7","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fcee6daceba272","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:20561fabeffbb0","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7450f8d809500d"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261010042813_02bba9df","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"section:8 统计学考虑|block:1056|chunk:1","quote":"有效性评价、安全性评价、PK 评价、PD 评价、免疫原性评价以及其他分析将在本研究的统计分析计划（SAP）中详细规定，数据库锁定前将最终确定 SAP。","quote_sha256":"a635fe9c51c78cbc66090c3553c488cd453e807e61608a97e0767740d5088a03","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a3cf98aab983c7","span_id":"es_sap_structure"},{"locator":"section:9.3.8 PK和E-R分析|block:897|chunk:1","quote":"在本研究中获得的所有CMS-D001及其主要代谢产物（如适用）的血药浓度数据将与前期已完成研究的数据合并，用于PopPK分析（使用非线性混合效应模型[NONMEM]），建立PopPK模型以表征CMSD-001及其主要代谢产物（如适用）在中重度特应性皮炎患者中的PK特征","quote_sha256":"237194263383cf9abf48d0effaaa656d0f6eba9570e32cccc8bd5f14cd994d30","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fcee6daceba272","span_id":"es_poppk_ref"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:revision:9","quote":"多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂平行对照、三剂量组（0.25mg BID/0.5mg BID/安慰剂1:1:1）设计；血液透析人群口服给药8周+2周安全随访。","quote_sha256":"ddc406df7f5484e2fcf536b3df7728545dcd261c5857f97bb1f06538b17801e1","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:r9:e734f05c4d419492","span_id":"es_design_3arm"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:revision:9","quote":"探索性目的：探索剂量-反应关系及PK特征","quote_sha256":"5c0e21e442845619befa123d1e1a76129f9548bea4fba3ddb8abe1aa30819344","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:r9:e734f05c4d419492","span_id":"es_pk_exploratory"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_sap_structure","es_poppk_ref","es_design_3arm","es_pk_exploratory"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":2,"project_fact_spans":2},"gap_items":[{"action":"确认PK采样方案（透析日与非透析日采样安排）及PKAS具体定义","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_pk_01","missing_source_classes":["项目PK研究方案"],"target":"PK数据分析章节-PK采样时间点与PK分析集定义"},{"action":"确认是否采用PopPK方法、是否合并既往研究数据、建模软件及协变量筛选策略","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_pk_02","missing_source_classes":["项目PK研究方案","项目SAP草案"],"target":"PK数据分析章节-PopPK建模策略"},{"action":"确认非房室分析参数列表及是否包含稳态PK参数","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_pk_03","missing_source_classes":["项目SAP草案"],"target":"PK数据分析章节-PK参数列表"}],"heading":"PK数据分析","missing_source_classes":["项目PK研究方案（含PK采样时间点、PK分析集定义、是否采用PopPK及建模策略）","项目SAP草案","KRX-203既往PK研究数据（用于判断是否合并分析）"],"proposal_text":"药代动力学（PK）分析为探索性分析，旨在表征口服KRX-203片在维持性血液透析慢性肾病相关瘙痒患者中的PK特征。PK分析基于PK分析集（PKAS），PKAS定义为至少提供一次可定量血药浓度数据的受试者。PK分析内容包括：采用非房室分析方法估算主要PK参数（包括但不限于Cmax、AUC0-t、AUC0-∞、tmax、t1/2、CL/F、Vd/F），按治疗组（0.25mg BID组、0.5mg BID组）分别汇总各时间点的血药浓度均值、标准差及几何均值。如数据量允许，将采用群体药代动力学（PopPK）方法建立KRX-203的群体PK模型，评估影响PK特征的内在因素（年龄、性别、体重、肾功能指标）和外在因素（合并用药、透析时间窗）对暴露量的影响。PK分析结果将用于支持暴露-效应分析，具体PK采样时间点、PK分析集定义、PopPK建模策略及PK参数列表将在统计分析计划（SAP）中详细规定，SAP于数据库锁定前最终确定。","rationale":"项目已确认PK特征为探索性目的，给药途径为口服、系统暴露、小分子药物；PopPK方法参照公司语料中同类小分子口服药物的结构惯例，但具体是否采用PopPK、是否合并既往研究数据、具体PK参数及采样方案需项目PK研究方案或SAP确认；PKAS定义中至少一次可定量数据为通用结构参照，需确认是否适用于本项目。","review_advisories":["本节引用公司语料形成共性表述；定稿时请用本项目权威文件复核适用性。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_ad1ab8acc74f_1beeae2855c12f6e","section_number":"9.6","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:aa5c2381f3120ea152da0a15","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:r9:e734f05c4d419492","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a3cf98aab983c7","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fcee6daceba272","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:20561fabeffbb0","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7450f8d809500d"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261010042813_02bba9df","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"确认本项目是否设置PD分析；若设置，需获取PD生物标志物清单、采样方案及分析方法","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_pd_01","missing_source_classes":["项目PD研究方案","KRX-203非临床PD数据"],"target":"PD数据分析章节-整章"}],"heading":"PD数据分析","missing_source_classes":["项目PD研究方案或PD生物标志物清单","KRX-203非临床PD数据（受体结合、下游信号通路）","项目SAP草案中PD分析部分"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"项目已确认研究事实中未列出任何PD终点、PD生物标志物或PD分析方法。研究目的中仅提及药理/药效探索作为内在研究目的，但未指定具体PD指标（如κ阿片受体相关生物标志物、瘙痒介质水平等）。公司语料中PD评价仅作为SAP结构中的通用类别提及，不构成本项目PD分析的具体依据。在缺少项目PD研究方案或PD生物标志物清单的情况下，无法形成有实质信息的正文。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_ad1ab8acc74f_f0f2cedd499eda13","section_number":"9.7","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:aa5c2381f3120ea152da0a15","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:r9:e734f05c4d419492","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a3cf98aab983c7","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fcee6daceba272","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:20561fabeffbb0","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7450f8d809500d"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261010042813_02bba9df","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:revision:9","quote":"主要估计目标：第8周WI-NRS周平均较基线下降≥4分应答，采用治疗策略估计目标（treatment policy），FAS；补救治疗按治疗策略纳入；缺失NRI主分析+tipping point敏感性；连续次要终点MMRM。","quote_sha256":"1f76246bb22b2e2d52b3d2bc36264d3b59aabaa1e33dacb5bc694ed88216c4c6","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:r9:e734f05c4d419492","span_id":"es_stat_strategy"},{"locator":"section:8 统计学考虑|block:1056|chunk:1","quote":"有效性评价、安全性评价、PK 评价、PD 评价、免疫原性评价以及其他分析将在本研究的统计分析计划（SAP）中详细规定，数据库锁定前将最终确定 SAP。","quote_sha256":"a635fe9c51c78cbc66090c3553c488cd453e807e61608a97e0767740d5088a03","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a3cf98aab983c7","span_id":"es_sap_structure"},{"locator":"section:9.3.8 PK和E-R分析|block:897|chunk:1","quote":"在本研究中获得的所有CMS-D001及其主要代谢产物（如适用）的血药浓度数据将与前期已完成研究的数据合并，用于PopPK分析（使用非线性混合效应模型[NONMEM]），建立PopPK模型以表征CMSD-001及其主要代谢产物（如适用）在中重度特应性皮炎患者中的PK特征","quote_sha256":"237194263383cf9abf48d0effaaa656d0f6eba9570e32cccc8bd5f14cd994d30","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fcee6daceba272","span_id":"es_poppk_ref"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:revision:9","quote":"多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂平行对照、三剂量组（0.25mg BID/0.5mg BID/安慰剂1:1:1）设计；血液透析人群口服给药8周+2周安全随访。","quote_sha256":"ddc406df7f5484e2fcf536b3df7728545dcd261c5857f97bb1f06538b17801e1","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:r9:e734f05c4d419492","span_id":"es_design_3arm"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:revision:9","quote":"探索性终点：血药浓度与瘙痒改善的暴露-效应关系","quote_sha256":"6a3d4db1653e1642659158210b63d390a185fa01e10602427c3ae7a87c802896","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:r9:e734f05c4d419492","span_id":"es_ee_endpoint"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_stat_strategy","es_sap_structure","es_poppk_ref","es_design_3arm","es_ee_endpoint"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":2,"project_fact_spans":3},"gap_items":[{"action":"确认E-R分析采用GLMM还是NONMEM、暴露参数选择（AUC/Cmax/Cavg）及是否包含安全性E-R","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_ee_01","missing_source_classes":["项目SAP草案"],"target":"暴露-效应分析章节-E-R建模方法与暴露参数"},{"action":"确认E-R分析集是否等同于PKAS或需额外限定疗效数据完整性","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_ee_02","missing_source_classes":["项目SAP草案"],"target":"暴露-效应分析章节-E-R分析集定义"}],"heading":"暴露-效应分析","missing_source_classes":["项目SAP草案（含E-R建模方法、暴露参数选择、分析集定义）","项目PK研究方案（用于确认暴露参数来源）"],"proposal_text":"暴露-效应（E-R）分析为探索性分析，旨在探索KRX-203血药浓度与瘙痒改善之间的暴露-效应关系。E-R分析基于PK分析集（PKAS）中同时具有可定量血药浓度数据和疗效评估数据的受试者。疗效端点包括第8周WI-NRS周平均值较基线下降≥4分的应答状态（二分类）及W2/W4/W6/W8各时间点WI-NRS周平均值较基线变化（连续变量）。暴露指标包括基于非房室分析或群体PK模型估算的个体暴露参数（如AUC、Cmax、Cavg）。E-R分析将采用广义线性混合效应模型或非线性混合效应模型，评估暴露量与疗效应答之间的相关性，并探索剂量-反应关系。安全性E-R分析将评估暴露量与TEAE发生率、QTcF变化等安全性指标之间的相关性。E-R分析结果将用于支持后续剂量选择，但不作为本研究主要或次要疗效结论的依据。具体E-R建模方法、暴露参数选择、协变量模型及分析集定义将在统计分析计划（SAP）中详细规定，SAP于数据库锁定前最终确定。","rationale":"项目已确认探索性终点为血药浓度与瘙痒改善的暴露-效应关系，探索性目的为探索剂量-反应关系及PK特征；主要终点（第8周WI-NRS应答）和连续次要终点（W2/W4/W6/W8 WI-NRS变化）为已确认事实；E-R分析中暴露参数和建模方法参照公司语料中同类小分子口服药物的结构惯例，具体方法需项目SAP确认；E-R分析集定义中同时具有PK和疗效数据为通用结构参照，需确认是否适用于本项目。","review_advisories":["本节提及高影响设计信息（剂量选择）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_ad1ab8acc74f_e60e06607195e395","section_number":"9.8","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:aa5c2381f3120ea152da0a15","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:r9:e734f05c4d419492","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a3cf98aab983c7","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fcee6daceba272","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:20561fabeffbb0","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7450f8d809500d"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"f23ca1169fef6190675a8862238f3c61188bd48b3284683ce8a3d7699bada213","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_ad1ab8acc74f_6d9208d7233030ca:full-draft:aa5c2381f3120ea152da0a15","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:aa5c2381f3120ea152da0a15","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-draft:2b84d56f7381ab57badd218418ca3197033eba48f09fde31a83dc955f19a788a:aa5c2381f3120ea152da0a15","text_sha256":"f23ca1169fef6190675a8862238f3c61188bd48b3284683ce8a3d7699bada213"},{"content_sha256":"56487773107202eb3a0cf101470d671f4797ddb0efe1253b921498f1e0118a89","locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:revision:9","role":"confirmed_project_facts","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:r9:e734f05c4d419492","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","source_version":"mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:r9:e734f05c4d419492","text_sha256":"56487773107202eb3a0cf101470d671f4797ddb0efe1253b921498f1e0118a89"},{"content_sha256":"a635fe9c51c78cbc66090c3553c488cd453e807e61608a97e0767740d5088a03","locator":"section:8 统计学考虑|block:1056|chunk:1","role":"company_sop_or_protocol_reference","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a3cf98aab983c7","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","source_version":"a3cf98aab983c7","text_sha256":"a635fe9c51c78cbc66090c3553c488cd453e807e61608a97e0767740d5088a03"},{"content_sha256":"5f8c9ccafc467af62ba815fdbdab90aa3d790da8dc9025e5a553ef4e8aeff778","locator":"section:9.3.8 PK和E-R分析|block:897|chunk:1","role":"company_sop_or_protocol_reference","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fcee6daceba272","source_type":"co